# check_immune with a vulnerability and a resistance or immunity to the same damage. Hassan (3011, in the temple,
# 4000 hit points) resists fire, and is immune and vulnerable to mental in stock's own area file. Smokegod (60) makes
# him vulnerable to fire too and casts burning hands at him; then immune to fire as well, and casts again. @state
# shows his hit points after each. check_immune's vulnerability test came after the immunity and resistance tests
# as an else, so it never saw them: resistant and vulnerable counted as resistant, and immune and vulnerable as
# immune (#56). Now they're normal and resistant.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
stat hassan
flag mob hassan vuln fire
stat hassan
cast 'burning hands' hassan
@pulse 12
@state
flag mob hassan immunity fire
cast 'burning hands' hassan
@pulse 12
@state
